<template>
 <section class="pg4-scenario"><p>Demo 数据，不代表真实模型响应、检索证据、工具调用或学习成绩。</p><Select v-model="scenarioState" label="场景状态" :options="scenarioStates.map(value=>({value,label:value}))" @change="log('fixture-state',$event)"/><p v-if="scenarioState==='loading'" role="status">本地Fixture加载中，不请求服务。</p><p v-else-if="scenarioState==='empty'" role="status">暂无本地Fixture内容。</p><div v-else-if="scenarioState==='error'"><p role="alert">场景加载失败（模拟），未连接业务服务。</p><Button @click="scenarioState='normal';log('fixture-retry',name)">重试场景</Button></div><p class="pg4-warning">Fixture 演示组件 / 非生产场景 · 不调用AI、检索、工具、学习或考试服务 · 分数不是客观成绩</p>
 <div v-if="['normal','disabled'].includes(scenarioState)" :inert="scenarioState==='disabled'||undefined" :aria-disabled="scenarioState==='disabled'||undefined" class="pg4-scenario">
 <template v-if="name==='AIChat'"><p class="pg4-user">你：{{lastUser}}</p><details><summary>公开说明 · Fixture</summary><p>这里仅展示预设的公开说明：先阅读示例，再观察依赖追踪；不是模型隐藏推理。</p></details><Markdown :content="answer||'助手：下面是**本地Fixture**回答。'"/><p v-if="failure" role="alert">模拟错误：未连接服务</p><div class="pg4-actions"><Button :disabled="busy" @click="stream">模拟流式回答</Button><Button variant="text" @click="failure=!failure">切换错误</Button><Button variant="text" @click="copy(answer)">复制</Button></div><div v-if="attachment" class="pg4-actions"><small>AttachmentPreview · fixture-notes.txt · 本地固定元数据</small><Button size="sm" variant="text" @click="attachment=false">移除Fixture附件</Button></div><Button v-if="failure" variant="text" @click="stream">RetryAction · 重新生成（Fixture）</Button><AIComposer v-model="draft" :busy="busy" :stoppable="busy" @submit="stream" @stop="stop"/></template>
 <template v-else-if="name==='RAG'"><Button @click="empty=!empty">切换无召回</Button><p v-if="empty" role="status">没有召回结果。证据不足，Fixture拒答。</p><template v-else><details v-for="(source,i) in sources" :key="source.title"><summary @click="log('fixture-source-toggle',source.title)">[{{i+1}}] {{source.title}} · 本地来源示例</summary><p>{{source.text}}</p></details><ExecutionTimeline :trace="trace"/><p>EvidencePanel：仅展示模拟来源，不证明真实证据充分。</p><Button size="sm" @click="documentOpen=true">DocumentPreview · 打开Fixture文档</Button><ConfirmDialog :open="documentOpen" title="Fixture 文档预览" description="这是一段本地文档摘要，不读取知识库或附件。" confirm-text="关闭预览" cancel-text="返回" @confirm="documentOpen=false" @cancel="documentOpen=false"/></template></template>
 <template v-else-if="name==='Agent'"><Select v-model="toolStatus" label="模拟工具状态" :options="['running','success','error','timeout'].map(value=>({value,label:value}))"/><ToolCard :tools="[{toolName:'fixture_search',status:toolStatus,args:{query:'本地示例'},description:'Fixture：未实际执行工具',result:toolStatus==='success'?'仅模拟结果，无真实工具调用':undefined,error:toolStatus==='error'||toolStatus==='timeout'?'模拟失败或超时':undefined}]"/><Button @click="toolStatus='running';log('fixture-retry',null)">模拟重试</Button><details><summary>公开执行阶段 · Fixture</summary><p>展示Action/Observation等公共状态；不冒充隐藏推理或真实工具事件。</p></details><fieldset><legend>ApprovalCard · Fixture</legend><p>允许本地演示显示一个模拟结果？不会授权或执行真实工具。</p><Button size="sm" @click="approval='允许演示';log('fixture-approval',approval)">允许模拟</Button><Button size="sm" variant="secondary" @click="approval='拒绝演示';log('fixture-approval',approval)">拒绝模拟</Button><p>{{approval}}</p></fieldset></template>
 <template v-else-if="name==='Flashcard'"><div class="pg4-actions"><Button variant="text" @click="empty=!empty">空卡片</Button><Checkbox v-model="cardLoading" label="Loading（Fixture）"/></div><Skeleton v-if="cardLoading" :rows="1" type="line"/><p v-if="empty">没有Fixture卡片</p><button v-else-if="!cardLoading" class="pg4-flashcard" :aria-label="flipped?'查看正面':'翻转卡片'" @click="flipped=!flipped;log('flip',flipped)">{{flipped?'背面：响应式追踪依赖并触发更新':'正面：什么是响应式？'}}</button><p>到期状态：固定Fixture · 未调用FSRS</p><div class="pg4-actions"><Button v-for="rating in ['重来','困难','良好','简单']" :key="rating" :disabled="empty||cardLoading" @click="count++;log('fixture-rating',rating)">{{rating}}</Button></div><Progress :percentage="Math.min(count*25,100)" show-label/></template>
 <template v-else-if="name==='SmartQuiz'"><div class="pg4-actions"><Button size="sm" @click="quizIndex=0;submitted=false">单选题</Button><Button size="sm" @click="quizIndex=1;submitted=false">多选题</Button></div><p>{{quizIndex===1?'虚拟题目：下面哪些属于前端框架？（多选）':'虚拟题目：哪个是数据库？（单选）'}}</p><Radio v-if="quizIndex===0" v-model="singleAnswer" label="本地单选答案" :options="['Vue','MySQL','React'].map(value=>({value,label:value}))" @change="log('fixture-answer',$event)"/><Checkbox v-for="option in quizIndex===1?['Vue','React','MySQL']:[]" :key="option" v-model="answers" :value="option" :label="option"/><Button @click="confirm=true">提交本地答案</Button><ConfirmDialog :open="confirm" title="确认Fixture答案？" confirm-text="确认Fixture" description="不提交考试或写入成绩" @cancel="confirm=false" @confirm="submitted=true;confirm=false;log('fixture-submit',answers)"/><p v-if="submitted">{{(quizIndex===0?singleAnswer==='MySQL':answers.includes('Vue')&&answers.includes('React')&&!answers.includes('MySQL'))?'参考答案匹配':'参考答案不匹配'}}；解析：Vue与React属于前端框架，MySQL是数据库。不是学习成绩。</p><p v-if="submitted">ResultSummary：本地Fixture已提交，不写入考试成绩。</p><Progress :percentage="submitted?100:0" show-label/></template>
 <template v-else-if="name==='Interview'"><p>Fixture问题：请解释事件循环。</p><Textarea v-model="draft" label="本地回答"/><Button @click="submitted=true;log('fixture-feedback',draft)">显示模拟反馈</Button><template v-if="submitted"><p>模拟反馈：可补充微任务与宏任务的执行顺序。以下分数仅用于UI展示，不是AI评价或客观成绩。</p><Progress :percentage="72" label="模拟表达清晰度" show-label/><Progress :percentage="65" label="模拟技术完整度" show-label/><Button variant="text" @click="count++;log('fixture-follow-up',count)">追问：Promise何时执行？</Button><p>当前进度 {{count}} · 完成状态仅本地</p></template></template>
 <template v-else-if="name==='TechEnglishTerm'"><Card><template #header>Dependency · 依赖（本地术语）</template><p>例句：Track a dependency before updating a value.</p><p>本地释义：一个值或模块依赖另一个值或模块。</p><Button @click="termExpanded=!termExpanded;log('fixture-term-expand',termExpanded)">展开术语说明</Button><p v-if="termExpanded">此卡不加载词库、不播放未核验录音、不加入真实复习。</p><Button variant="secondary" @click="log('fixture-review-request','dependency')">模拟加入复习</Button></Card></template>
 <template v-else-if="name==='NoteEditorDialog'"><Button @click="noteOpen=true;log('fixture-note-open',true)">编辑本地笔记</Button><AppDialog :open="noteOpen" title="编辑本地笔记" scrollable @cancel="closeNote" @confirm="saveNote"><Input v-model="noteTitle" label="笔记标题"/><Textarea v-model="noteBody" label="笔记正文"/><p v-if="noteError" role="alert">{{noteError}}</p><p>草稿只在当前Story内保存，切换后销毁；未写服务端主库。</p></AppDialog><ConfirmDialog :open="discardOpen" title="放弃本地草稿？" description="仅丢弃当前Fixture内容" @confirm="discardOpen=false;noteOpen=false;log('fixture-note-discard',null)" @cancel="discardOpen=false"/></template>
 </div></section>
</template>
<script setup lang="ts">
import {ref,defineAsyncComponent,onBeforeUnmount} from 'vue'
import {scenarioStates} from './scenarios-v6'
import AppDialog from '@/components/ui/AppDialog.vue'
import Input from '@/components/ui/Input.vue'
import Card from '@/components/ui/Card.vue'
import Radio from '@/components/ui/Radio.vue'
import Button from '@/components/ui/Button.vue'
import Select from '@/components/ui/Select.vue'
import Checkbox from '@/components/ui/Checkbox.vue'
import Textarea from '@/components/ui/Textarea.vue'
import Progress from '@/components/ui/Progress.vue'
import Skeleton from '@/components/ui/SkeletonList.vue'
import ConfirmDialog from '@/components/ui/ConfirmDialog.vue'
import AIComposer from '@/components/ai/AIComposer.vue'
const Markdown=defineAsyncComponent(()=>import('@/components/chat/ChatMarkdownRenderer.vue')),ExecutionTimeline=defineAsyncComponent(()=>import('@/components/chat/ExecutionTimeline.vue')),ToolCard=defineAsyncComponent(()=>import('@/components/chat/AgentToolCard.vue'))
const scenarioDefault='normal'
const props=defineProps<{name:string;fixture?:Record<string,unknown>}>();const quizIndex=ref(1),singleAnswer=ref<string|number>(''),lastUser=ref('如何理解Vue响应式？'),attachment=ref(true),documentOpen=ref(false),approval=ref('待选择（Fixture）'),cardLoading=ref(!!props.fixture?.cardLoading)
const emit=defineEmits<{event:[name:string,value:unknown]}>(),draft=ref(''),answer=ref(''),busy=ref(false),failure=ref(false),empty=ref(!!props.fixture?.empty),flipped=ref(false),count=ref(0),answers=ref<string[]>([]),submitted=ref(false),confirm=ref(false),toolStatus=ref(String(props.fixture?.toolStatus||'running'))
const scenarioState=ref(String(props.fixture?.scenarioState||scenarioDefault)),termExpanded=ref(false),noteOpen=ref(false),discardOpen=ref(false),noteTitle=ref('响应式笔记'),noteBody=ref('本地示例正文'),noteError=ref('')
function closeNote(){if(noteTitle.value!=='响应式笔记'||noteBody.value!=='本地示例正文')discardOpen.value=true;else noteOpen.value=false}
function saveNote(){if(!noteTitle.value.trim()){noteError.value='请输入本地标题';return}noteError.value='';noteOpen.value=false;log('fixture-note-save',{title:noteTitle.value,body:noteBody.value})}
const sources=[{title:'Fixture · Vue学习笔记',score:'0.86',text:'响应式系统收集依赖，并在数据变化时触发更新。'},{title:'Fixture · 事件循环',score:'0.72',text:'此片段是本地演示文本，不是知识库召回结果。'}]
const trace={strategy:'fixture',evidenceSufficient:false,resultCount:2,steps:[{type:'search',label:'Fixture检索步骤（未执行）',status:'success',detail:'仅演示轨迹展示，不是后台执行证据'}]}
function log(name:string,value:unknown){emit('event',name,value)}
let timer:ReturnType<typeof setInterval>|undefined
function stop(){clearInterval(timer);busy.value=false;log('fixture-stop',null)}
function stream(){stop();failure.value=false;lastUser.value=draft.value.trim()||lastUser.value;log('fixture-message',lastUser.value);answer.value='';busy.value=true;const text='Fixture：Vue通过依赖追踪实现响应式。\n\n```ts\nconst count = ref(0)\n```';let i=0;timer=setInterval(()=>{answer.value=text.slice(0,++i);if(i>=text.length){stop();log('fixture-stream-complete',text)}},12)}
async function copy(text:string){try{await navigator.clipboard.writeText(text);log('copy',text)}catch{log('copy-error','剪贴板不可用')}}
onBeforeUnmount(()=>clearInterval(timer))
</script>
<style scoped>
.pg4-scenario{display:grid;gap:var(--kb-space-4);min-width:0}.pg4-warning{font-size:var(--kb-fs-body-sm);color:var(--kb-muted-foreground)}.pg4-user{justify-self:end;padding:var(--kb-space-3);background:var(--kb-muted);border-radius:var(--kb-radius-lg)}.pg4-actions{display:flex;gap:var(--kb-space-2);flex-wrap:wrap}.pg4-flashcard{padding:var(--kb-space-8);border:1px solid var(--kb-border);border-radius:var(--kb-radius-lg);background:var(--kb-card);min-height:10rem}details{padding:var(--kb-space-3);border:1px solid var(--kb-border);border-radius:var(--kb-radius-md)}summary{cursor:pointer}button:focus-visible,summary:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--kb-ring);outline-offset:2px}
</style>
